      "originalText": "Case (2): Compound investor\n• Reinvest all winnings into the next spin\n• A long-term investor compounding gains\n\n→ Pick the wheel with the highest geometric mean: #1!\n (#1: 1.26 > #3: 0.89 > #2: 0.00)"
    },
