    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text3",
      "x": 179,
      "y": 443.5,
      "width": 383,
      "height": 183,
      "text": "[!] What you must NEVER pick\n\nWheel #2's geometric mean is 0!\nCompound long enough and a 0× will eventually land —\nand the moment it does, you lose everything.\n\n$1,000 × ... × 1.5 × 2.0 × 0.0 = $0 [BUST]\nNo matter how much you won before, one 0 ends it.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
